# Illustration PNG masters from scripts/generate-illustrations.ts. Two to
# three megabytes each, eighteen of them. The WebP variants beside them are
# what the pages load and are committed; a master can be regenerated with the
# script (a paid call) or re-encoded from the 1536 variant, which is already
# full resolution. REDESIGN_NOTES.md records the decision.
public/illustrations/*.png
